{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about harvesting apples all year round through the power of dance! Pay attention to the sage's moves, when it's your turn repeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though, dancing is not all you'll be doing: At the end of each season a fearsome foe will crash your party... no more dancing! Dodge their attacks and parry stars to defeat them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through four stages (seasons): Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against bosses at the end of each season!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties to select from, including a &quot;Custom&quot; mode to tweak the game to your liking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All game modes can be played up to four players!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade:</strong> Go through all four seasons and beat the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush:</strong> No apples! Defeat every boss in a row.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless:</strong> Only apples! Harvest as many as you can without making mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus:</strong> Take turns deciding moves and outperform your friends!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Versus is the only mode that requires a minimum of two players.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spring Cleaning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506210/bce0a64ca42ed52d09f66be0b0cdc9f584888703.jpg"},{"name":"Summer Heat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3506210/aa3d9bb11efe5fb3408a0b500333c5378bb2a51c.jpg"},{"name":"Autumn Falls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta